---
import { links } from "../data/site";
---

<section class="join section-shell" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-title">
  <div class="join-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span>06</span> JOIN US</p>
    <h2 id="join-title">次の問いを，<br />持ってきて．</h2>
    <p>connpassで参加登録して，当日のLT会へ．Discordへの参加方法は，各イベントページで案内しています．</p>
  </div>
  <div class="join-actions">
    <a class="join-card join-card-primary" href={links.connpass} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      <span>EVENTS</span>
      <strong>connpass</strong>
      <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
    </a>
    <a class="join-card" href={links.note} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      <span>STORIES</span>
      <strong>note</strong>
      <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
